---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">
    <span class="dot-pulse"></span>
    Built for Global SMBs — Restaurants &amp; Businesses
  </div>
  <h1>One platform.<br><span class="accent">Many tools.</span><br>Zero headaches.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Foaps gives small and medium businesses the tech that big chains have — at a fraction of the cost, with none of the hidden charges.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="#products" class="btn btn-fill">Explore our products →</a>
    <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-outline">Talk to us</a>
  </div>
  <!-- <div class="hero-trust">
    <div class="trust-item">🍴 Built for restaurants</div>
    <div class="trust-item">💬 WhatsApp-native</div>
    <div class="trust-item">🚫 No hidden charges</div>
    <div class="trust-item">📦 All-in-one suite</div>
  </div> -->
  <div class="product-strip">
    <a href="https://receiver.foaps.co" class="strip-pill"><span class="pill-dot" style="background:var(--orange)"></span>Foaps Receiver</a>
    <a href="https://direct.foaps.co" class="strip-pill"><span class="pill-dot" style="background:var(--green)"></span>Foaps Direct</a>
    <a href="https://orderpipe.foaps.co" class="strip-pill"><span class="pill-dot" style="background:var(--purple)"></span>Orderpipe</a>
    <a href="https://engage.foaps.co" class="strip-pill"><span class="pill-dot" style="background:var(--amber)"></span>Foaps Engage</a>
    <a href="https://navigate.foaps.co" class="strip-pill"><span class="pill-dot" style="background:var(--blue)"></span>Foaps Navigate</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 148px 6% 96px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -40px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 800px;
    height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(244, 80, 28, 0.07) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--orange-bg);
    color: var(--orange);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(244, 80, 28, 0.15);
  }

  .dot-pulse {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background: var(--orange);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -2.5px;
    line-height: 1.06;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
  }

  .hero h1 .accent {
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 20px);
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-weight: 400;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 44px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-actions .btn {
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 13px 28px;
  }

  .hero-trust {
    margin-top: 56px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .trust-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--ink-4);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .product-strip {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 72px;
  }

  .strip-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .strip-pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--ink-3);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .pill-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
</style>
